<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Guides on Cribl Python SDK</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/guides/</link><description>Recent content in Guides on Cribl Python SDK</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/guides/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Getting Started</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/guides/getting-started/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/guides/getting-started/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="getting-started"&gt;Getting Started&lt;a class="anchor" href="#getting-started"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Install the SDK and make your first API call against Cribl.Cloud or an on-prem Leader. One &lt;code&gt;Cribl&lt;/code&gt;
client covers the control plane and the Cribl.Cloud platform API, with authentication and token refresh
handled for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="install"&gt;Install&lt;a class="anchor" href="#install"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requires &lt;strong&gt;Python 3.14&lt;/strong&gt; or later.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="book-tabs" &gt;
&lt;input type="radio" class="toggle" name="tabs-4" id="tabs-4-0" checked="checked" /&gt;&lt;label for="tabs-4-0"&gt;uv&lt;/label&gt;&lt;div class="book-tabs-content markdown-inner"&gt;
&lt;div id="uv"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
&lt;button type="button" class="code-copy" data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy code" hidden&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;uv add cribl-python-sdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" class="toggle" name="tabs-4" id="tabs-4-1" /&gt;&lt;label for="tabs-4-1"&gt;pip&lt;/label&gt;&lt;div class="book-tabs-content markdown-inner"&gt;
&lt;div id="pip"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
&lt;button type="button" class="code-copy" data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy code" hidden&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;pip install cribl-python-sdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;input type="radio" class="toggle" name="tabs-4" id="tabs-4-2" /&gt;&lt;label for="tabs-4-2"&gt;poetry&lt;/label&gt;&lt;div class="book-tabs-content markdown-inner"&gt;
&lt;div id="poetry"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
&lt;button type="button" class="code-copy" data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy code" hidden&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;poetry add cribl-python-sdk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id="quickstart"&gt;Quickstart&lt;a class="anchor" href="#quickstart"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A complete script: check server health, list Worker Groups, then list Sources and Pipelines in one group.
Replace the placeholders with your own values.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>How-to</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/guides/how-to/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/guides/how-to/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Beyond the &lt;a href="https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/guides/getting-started/"&gt;Getting Started&lt;/a&gt; basics: paging through list results, handling errors,
tuning retries and bringing your own HTTP client. Each snippet is self-contained.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="pagination"&gt;Pagination&lt;a class="anchor" href="#pagination"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;List operations return &lt;code&gt;SDKResponse[PaginatedResponse[T]]&lt;/code&gt; (see &lt;a href="https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/models/paginatedresponse/"&gt;&lt;code&gt;PaginatedResponse&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;). Most accept &lt;code&gt;offset&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;limit&lt;/code&gt;;
the page carries &lt;code&gt;items&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;count&lt;/code&gt; and, when the server reports it, &lt;code&gt;total_count&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
&lt;button type="button" class="code-copy" data-label="Copy" aria-label="Copy code" hidden&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;cribl_python_sdk&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Cribl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;Cribl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;server_url&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://your-leader:9000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;bearer_auth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;your-token&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;limit&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;100&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;while&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;page&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;collectors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;list&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;limit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;limit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;job&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;items&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;job&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;limit&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;total_count&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;not&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="ow"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;offset&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;total_count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;break&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id="errors"&gt;Errors&lt;a class="anchor" href="#errors"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HTTP errors raise a subclass of &lt;a href="https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/errors/apierror/"&gt;&lt;code&gt;APIError&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; carrying &lt;code&gt;status_code&lt;/code&gt;,
&lt;code&gt;message&lt;/code&gt; and the raw &lt;code&gt;response&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Cribl.Cloud Examples</title><link>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/guides/examples-cloud/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://criblio.github.io/cribl-python-sdk/latest/docs/guides/examples-cloud/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="criblcloud-examples"&gt;Cribl.Cloud Examples&lt;a class="anchor" href="#criblcloud-examples"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
